<header><p class="enc-kicker">Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sugarcane</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sugarcane is a tall tropical grass whose stalks are crushed to produce <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sugar-plantation">sugar</a>. It was cultivated in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a> since ancient times. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maratha-empire">Maratha Empire</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sikh-empire">Sikh Empire</a> profiles list sugarcane among their agricultural products.</p></div>
